223	| 3 | `FilterSheetApplied` with 1 entry type + a date range, no query | single `list(source: ..., dateFrom: ..., dateTo: ...)` call, cursor-paginated (`nextCursor` non-null when the backend returns one) |
224	| 4 | `FilterSheetApplied` with 2 entry types, no query | two `list()` calls (one per type, `limit: 50`), merged+deduped+sorted by `occurredAt` desc, `nextCursor: null` |
