236	| 16 | `CriteriaLoadRetried` succeeds (simulating reconnection) after a prior `criteriaLoadFailure`, where some IDs in the stale cached `entries` also appear in the fresh server response | the emitted `entries` equals the fresh response exactly — no ID appears twice, and no leftover cached-only entry survives the replace (SC-006: the fetch is a full replace, never a merge, so reconnection can never duplicate an entry) |
